MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_001: Damn lousy day... Huh? Oh, well if it isn't the\nPromised One.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_002: <NCA>"Had a bit too much to drink?"
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_003: Ha! What a joke! The great Majide can drink as\nmuch as he wants. I never get sick from the stuff!
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_004: Or I haven't since a while ago. Long while. Doesn't\nmatter anyway. I heal up real quick.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_005: So, nah. I'm just in a bad mood... I bumped into an\nold buddy.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_006: A guy who was gonna be in the Heroic Games with\nme... Yeah, in my clan, Southern Cross Brigade.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_007: <NCA>"That's not...a good thing?"
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_008: Nuh-uh... See, we got duped. The Order of Mithras\nrounded us up. Me and all those schmucks.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_009: Those dopes were never gonna hold their own.\nI was the only one who had a chance.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_010: But I really, really DID want to win the games. Had a\ndecent wish ready too. Then...I never got a chance.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_011: Yeah, seeing that poor guy brought it ALL back.\nNever had a shot... Never did...
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_012: <NCA>"What was your wish?"
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_013: <NCB>"It's still nice to have a dream."
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_014: <ACA>Ugh. I'm not gonna tell you... Wasn't gonna\nhappen anyway.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_015: <ACB>Aw, c'mon. Spare me. That dream's dead and\ngone. That's that.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_016: Hmm.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_017: Fine! You want to know? Need a laugh, huh? Then\nhere's my big wish.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_018: The great Majide wanted to rule Dagsion!
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_019: Then I lose to that damned Dietrich... Get thrown\nout like trash by the Order of Mithras...
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_020: Solel goes and dies... Dagda went nuts and MADE\neverything nuts...
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_021: And now Balor! What the hell?! Those guys from my\nclan gotta be laughing whenever they think of me!
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_022: Stop that staring. Laugh already. C'mon, let it\nall out. Majide and his stupid dream...
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_023: <NCA>"Why did you want to rule Dagsion?"
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_024: Huh? I dunno... 'Cause it's there?
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_025: Guess I figured...if a scrawny guy like Solel can\ndo it, why not me?
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_026: <NCA>"Aha! I get it now!"
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_027: Oh, now you laugh? Shoulda kept my damn\nmouth shut.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_028: Least talking about it isn't half bad. So, what's next,\nPromised One? You really gonna save the world?
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_029: Alright, count me in. Been trying to stay low, but\nnow you got me interested.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_030: Not doing it for you though. Not trying to save the\nworld. I just want my wish—MY Dagsion!
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_A_031: Balor can stuff it! That pig isn't gonna raze my city\nto the ground. He's gonna answer to ME!
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_001: I always forget how damn huge Dagsion looks\nfrom up here...
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_002: I mean, I know how huge the city is. I guess...I\njust feel smaller without you around.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_003: Thought you'd come back, but you disappeared real\ngood. Yeah, you are gone, gone, gone...
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_004: Gotta admit too—the underworld gave even the\ngreat Majide the creeps. Juuust a little bit.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_005: <NCA>"Only a little bit?"
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_006: Yeah, barely at all. I mean, if I felt like it, I'd get back\ndown there and scoop you riiight up... Wait...
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_007: Y-you're BACK! The dead walk again! B-but we\nbeat Balor! Dead should be staying DEAD!
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_008: <NCA>"I'm alive, Majide!"
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_009: <NCB>"Now, calm down there."
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_010: <ACA>Shut up and DIE! Rrraagh!
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_011: <ACB>I'll calm down when you're dead AGAIN!\nRraaaagh!
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_026: 
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_012: Haaah... Haaah... Next time, give a guy some\nwarning you're still alive! All outta breath here...
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_013: I thought I was strong! Guess you're no pushover\neither. Huh, anyway. Got something to tell you.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_014: Hehe, you won't believe this. The great Majide...\nis a temple soldier now!
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_015: Me, keepin' the peace! I walk around Dagsion...\nWallop any thieves I see...
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_016: Balor's gone, yeah. But everything's still a mess.\nThere aren't enough folks to help out.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_017: Lot of people just trying to get by these days. Keeps\nme on my toes, with some riots breakin' out.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_018: Some guys said the temples took me in only to keep\nan eye on me. But, uh, they're wrong, yeah?
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_019: See, I knew it! All those priests are trustin' me to\ndo the right thing here.
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_020: Eh, gotta admit the work can be dull, and I kind of\nhate it sometimes. But still...
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_021: Least you and me had a chance to get in some good\nbattles along the way. It was a good time, yeah?
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_022: <NCA>"A real good time."
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_025: 
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_023: <RSDS>Hey! Know what? I got a new plan... I'm gonna\nwork my way up the ranks here in Dagsion!
MID_SE_Ism_Maj_S_024: Yeah, who needed Solel anyway? I'll grant my OWN\nwish! I'm gonna rule here. Just watch me go!